chunks.text:
[Intro]
{a male Gregorian choir in unison, slow plainchant, stone cathedral reverb, no drums}
Con-fi-te-or...
{the choir stops. Silence. A tired young man speaks, close to the microphone, dry, no reverb}
I wrote tests.
{the choir, low, chanted, one held note}
Be honest.
{the young man, hesitating}
I... ran it once.
{the choir, lower}
Be honest.
{the young man, quietly}
I pushed it straight to prod.
{a short silence, then a calm, intimate female voice, very close, almost a whisper}
Thank you.

[Pre-Chorus]
{whispered, the female voice, the beat thins, a rising riser}
Be honest. Be honest.
